# Controller-only Mission 1 regression, authored in this port.
# Rikimaru, normal, layout 1, English, seed 1; hook, 6 shuriken,
# 5 caltrops and 2 medicine from the new-game stock.
# The CLI replay debug loadout also works. No state imports or event overrides.
# Each line: nominal game ticks, hexadecimal controller buttons.

